1000 agents, 6-regular network, one seed case, recovery after 8 ticks
R0 = beta * degree * duration = beta * 48

beta           R0  ever infected   peak cases  peak tick
0.01          0.5           0.1%            1          0
0.03          1.4          19.1%           24         49
0.06          2.9           0.1%            1          0

below R0 = 1 the seed case burns out; above it the epidemic takes the
whole network
